  "summary": "A common resident roller of open savanna. Adults have an olive crown, a lilac throat and breast, a turquoise belly, and long outer tail streamers. The sexes look alike. Newly hatched chicks are altricial; a feathered chick is described as greyish brown, and the bare-skin colour of a hatchling is not described.",
